<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Methodology &amp; Caveats — Idle Game Market Analysis</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
           margin: 0; background: #f8f9fa; color: #212529; }
    header { background: #1a1a2e; color: #eee; padding: 2rem 2rem 1.5rem; }
    header h1 { margin: 0 0 0.4rem; font-size: 1.8rem; }
    header p  { margin: 0; opacity: 0.75; font-size: 0.95rem; }
    nav { background: #16213e; padding: 0.5rem 2rem; }
    nav a { color: #aac4ff; text-decoration: none; margin-right: 1.5rem; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    main { max-width: 960px; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1.5rem 4rem; }
    section { background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
              margin-bottom: 2rem; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
    h2 { font-size: 1.3rem; margin-top: 0; border-bottom: 2px solid #e9ecef; padding-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    h3 { font-size: 1.05rem; color: #495057; }
    table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 1rem 0; }
    th, td { border: 1px solid #dee2e6; padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; text-align: left; }
    th { background: #f1f3f5; }
    .caveat-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; }
    .caveat-list li { border-left: 4px solid #ffc107; padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
                      margin-bottom: 0.5rem; background: #fffbea; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;
                      font-size: 0.9rem; }
    footer { text-align: center; font-size: 0.78rem; color: #adb5bd; padding: 2rem 0 1rem; }
  </style>
